{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-screens-1-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-1","refs":["F-phone-100","F-phone-137","FN-B-alerts-phone-cloud-backup-ai-b-03"],"severity":"S4","title":"The gym's server records a trainer reply as seen before the member has opened it","what":"Every time the app starts or comes back to the front, it quietly asks the gym's server for the member's questions to work out the red count on the Gym tab. That same request tells the server the replies were seen. So the server's 'seen' time is set within minutes of a reply, while the phone itself still shows the reply as new and unread. The staff copy of each question carries this 'seen' time; today no admin screen shows it, so nobody is misled yet.","expected":"A reply counts as seen only when the member opens Ask about your workout, and the server and the phone keep the same mark, so any future 'seen' sign for staff tells the truth.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/app/_layout.tsx:145-153","apps/mobile/src/shop/askReplySync.ts:99-110","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymApi.ts:572-574","supabase/migrations/0053_ask_trainer_and_progress.sql:182","supabase/migrations/0053_ask_trainer_and_progress.sql:296-299"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"reply-seen-set-by-background-count","who":"trainers and owners (if a seen sign is ever shown)","how_often":"every reply","fix_line":"Read the count without marking anything seen, and mark seen only when the member opens the page","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-screens-1-b-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-1","refs":["F-phone-137","FN-B-alerts-phone-components-2-b-03"],"severity":"S4","title":"A trainer's reply pop-up stays in the phone's notification list after the member has read the reply in the app","what":"When the gym answers a workout question, the phone shows a pop-up. If the member opens the app another way and reads the reply, the red count on the Gym tab goes away, but the pop-up stays in the pulled-down notification list until swiped away. Tapping it later opens a reply already read.","expected":"Opening the reply in the app also takes its pop-up away.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeAlertsRun.ts:380-384","apps/mobile/src/shop/askReplySync.ts:50-57","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymTalkSync.ts:122-125"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"reply-popup-not-cleared-on-read","who":"members","how_often":"every reply read without tapping its pop-up","fix_line":"When the reply page marks replies read, also clear their pop-ups","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
